flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[/Customer sends WhatsApp message/]
    B --> C[Receive WhatsApp webhook]
    C --> D{Signature valid?}
    D -- No --> E[Reject request / 403]
    E --> Z([END])
    D -- Yes --> F[Store webhook event / process message]
    F --> G{Customer exists?}
    G -- No --> H[Create customer]
    G -- Yes --> I[Load customer]
    H --> J[Create / open conversation]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Store message + media/location]
    K --> L[Update conversation + customer activity]
    L --> M[Run automation rules]
    M --> N{Matching automation?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Execute action / schedule follow-up]
    N -- No --> P[Notify staff]
    O --> Q[Broadcast real-time update]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Admin sees message in Inbox]
    R --> S{Admin needs to respond?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Compose text / media / location]
    T --> U[Send through WhatsApp Cloud API]
    U --> V{Sent successfully?}
    V -- No --> W[Mark failed + allow retry]
    W --> R
    V -- Yes --> X[Track sent → delivered → read]
    X --> Y{Sales action?}
    Y -- No --> Z
    Y -- Yes --> AA[Update CRM / pipeline]
    AA --> AB[Create / update order]
    AB --> AC[Assign delivery]
    AC --> AD[Processing → Out for delivery → Delivered]
    AD --> AE[Reports / revenue / COGS / performance]
    AE --> Z

    subgraph ADMIN[Admin Web Application]
        R
        T
        AA
        AB
        AC
        AE
    end

    subgraph AUTOMATION[Automation Engine]
        M
        N
        O
    end
